{"id":"4aa3e02d8da9096c","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-subterm-property.md","title":"df-subterm-property","display":"df-subterm-property","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-subterm-property","aliases":["56-df-subterm-property"],"display":"df-subterm-property","depends_on":["[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]"],"source_section":"6.3.14–6.3.15","source_pages":"204","source_ocr_blocks":[225],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-subterm-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-subterm-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subterm-property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.3.14–6.3.15"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"204"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>225</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T^2\">\\(Q\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空位置。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pos}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pos}(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t|_p\">\\(t|_p\\)</span> 及真子项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubtermProp}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)\\iff\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(t)\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\;\nt\\;Q\\;(t|_p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SubtermProp}_{\\Sigma,V}(Q)\\iff\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Pos}(t)\\setminus\\{\\epsilon\\}\\;\nt\\;Q\\;(t|_p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 6.3.14 的子项条件的全真子项表达。对替换和上下文封闭的严格序，要求 f(x₁,…,xₙ)&gt;xᵢ 与要求每个项大于全部真子项等价：先替换得到任意直接参数下降，再沿项树用传递性得到所有真子项。变量和常元没有真子项，故条件在它们上为空。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.3.14–6.3.15，印刷页 204。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position